  {"note":"C8 dreams: jumpTo('finale', play) -> the Starchart -> the night before ('Rest tonight.': Kade and BOLT at pod 07 at reading speed, the rest fast) -> the flight -> the Heart; Kade's dream at reading speed (WARDEN over gold, Voss, the refusal), Nyx (Stay.), Orion and Sera fast, each back to the exact spot with its keepsake -> the Sanctum rest -> the crown lift -> dreams.crown: lost once (Retry from the Sanctum, the approach auto-skips), then won -> the resolution at reading speed (the fold, HALCYON out of BOLT, 'I was so afraid for them.' / 'I know. Me too.', the merge, morning, the lullaby) -> the EPILOGUE card -> halcyon:cryo (autosave) -> the epilogue begins"},
